> From: "Piotrovskij, Vladimir [JanBe]" <VPIOTROV at janbe.jnj.com>
> Date: Thu, 9 Nov 2000 14:15:49 +0100 
> 
> Dear S+ users,
> Is anybody aware of a function which samples from bivariate uniform
> distribution? By analogy to the standard runif() the call may look as
> follows:
> rbvunif(n, xymin=0, xmax=1, ymax=1)

It's two independent uniform samples, so

matrix(runif(2*n), n, 2)

is a sample from [0, 1] x [0, 1].  And so on.

