From ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk  Sun Nov 12 07:52:14 2000
From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian D Ripley)
Date: Sun, 12 Nov 2000 07:52:14 +0000
Subject: Re: Definition of BIC: factor of -2 or not?
In-Reply-To: <p05001903b633960f835c@[10.0.1.3]>
